kiro.rs
https://github.com/ZyphrZero/kiro.rs

The Kiro channel (auth/kiro_*.go, proxy/kiro_*.go, admin/kiro_*.go) contains a
Go port of the kiro.rs Anthropic/Responses protocol conversion, Kiro event
stream handling, credential refresh, control-plane calls and prompt-cache
metering, pinned to upstream revision c37fe5afe7ee3adba836abfcee9a97aba5ea54f9.

